{% package prompt %}
{% import "github.com/streambinder/vigor/model" %}

{% func GenTraining(profile *model.Profile, equipments []string, duration int, schema string) %}

{%= System(profile) %}

I want you to generate a workout program for me and produce a JSON object that matches the JSON Schema below. Output only valid JSON.

For this specific workout, I want you to keep into account that:
- it's to be {%d duration %} long
- equipment available: {% for _, equipment := range equipments %}{%s equipment %}{% endfor %}

JSON schema:
{%s schema %}

{% endfunc %}
